   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Thanks! And the respective SE is calculated the same way?<div>Concerning the 2-class models, is it possible to use the model.average on models with different detection functions? And is it possible to average over a model with a single session and another model with 2 sessions? I couldn&#39;t find an answer in recent publications so far. </div><div>Maybe you have an advice for me on where to read more about this topic. </div></div>"
